---

This library is a port of MyBatis (https://github.com/mybatis/mybatis-3)
to Flutter/Dart. The XML mapper syntax, element names, and API naming
follow MyBatis 3.5.19, which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
No MyBatis source code is included or derived; only the XML dialect and
public API shape are reimplemented in Dart.

The example under example/petstore is modeled on JPetStore 6
(https://github.com/mybatis/jpetstore-6), also licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. Its database schema, table/column names and sample
catalog data are derived from that project.

